aerographene: nome padrão do .desktop e ícone sem depender de CHROME_DESKTOP.

Origem: aerographene (original). Licença: GPL-3.0.
Propósito: sem `CHROME_DESKTOP` (binário executado direto, sem
packaging/arch/aerographene-wrapper), o Chromium usa `chromium-browser.desktop`, e a
janela sai com WM_CLASS `chromium-browser`/`Chromium-browser` e ícone `chromium-browser`.
O padrão passa a ser `aerographene.desktop` (WM_CLASS/app_id `aerographene`, classe
`Aerographene`, igual a StartupWMClass) e o ícone `aerographene` (hicolor do pacote).
`CHROME_DESKTOP` e `--class` continuam sobrepondo.

--- a/chrome/common/channel_info_posix.cc
+++ b/chrome/common/channel_info_posix.cc
@@ -148,7 +148,7 @@
   if (name.has_value() && !name.value().empty()) {
     return name.value();
   }
-  return "chromium-browser.desktop";
+  return "aerographene.desktop";
 #endif
 }
 #endif  // BUILDFLAG(IS_LINUX)
--- a/chrome/browser/shell_integration_linux.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/shell_integration_linux.cc
@@ -471,7 +471,7 @@
 #if BUILDFLAG(GOOGLE_CHROME_BRANDING)
   return "google-chrome";
 #else  // BUILDFLAG(CHROMIUM_BRANDING)
-  return "chromium-browser";
+  return "aerographene";
 #endif
 }
 
